<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-MUNICH MEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MUNICH MEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in</p>
<p>the $425,000 Munich men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy)</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat Frederik Fetterlein</p>
<p>(Denmark)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>6-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>7-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat 2-Carlos Moya (Spain) 7-5 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
</text>
